+        <dt>
+            <code class=attribute-name>
+                <a id="DOM-WebGLShaderPrecisionFormat-rangeMax">
+                    rangeMax
+                </a>
+            </code>
+            of type <code>GLint</code>
+        <dd>
+            The base 2 log of the absolute value of the maximum value that can be represented.
